    "body": "Well, that implies we control the environment in which the test is being run.\r\nOn a dev machine, the user is not an admin, on the CI, the user is.\r\nThat would mean we test before hand if the current user is an admin, to properly set \"expected\" value. \r\nIs that what you expect? \r\n",
