    "body": "I perfectly understand the rationale behind your review and it perfectly makes sense.\r\nI will think about a pragmatic way to implement and report back here.\r\nWhat would make little sense (to me) is to determine whether the process running the test is admin/non admin the exact same way the module does to set the expectations.\r\n",
